                "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued November 15 at 9:00AM CST by NWS Bismarck ND",
                "description": "Patchy fog will reduce the visibility to one quarter mile or less\nin parts of western North Dakota this morning. Motorists should\nbe prepared for rapidly changing visibilities, and should use\nextra caution traveling. Use low beam headlights and be extra\ncautious at intersections and railroad crossings.\n\nThe fog is expected to dissipate by the late morning.",
